{{trans-bottom}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To advance funds on loan.
#* '''February 23 1780''', {{w|Edmund Burke}}, ''Establism Bill''
#*:it shall not be lawful to '''imprest''' or issue to the paymaster general of his majesty's land forces 

